{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21179","headline":"春余遣兴 · 元稹","name":"春余遣兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春去日渐迟，庭空草偏长。\n余英间初实，雪絮萦蛛网。\n好鸟多息阴，新篁已成响。\n帘开斜照入，树褭游丝上。\n绝迹念物闲，良时契心赏。\n单衣颇新绰，虚室复清敞。\n置酒奉亲宾，树萱自怡养。\n笑倚连枝花，恭扶瑞藤杖。\n步屧恣优游，望山多气象。\n云叶遥卷舒，风裾动萧爽。\n簪缨固烦杂，江海徒浩荡。\n野马笼赤霄，无由负羁鞅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}